editor_description = "[필수] 지우면 오류 — HubView.gd _refresh_map()
Code adds the team's BaseMap (BaseMap.create(RunRules.team_map_id), DESIGN_SIZE 1000×634) here, centred, and one ResearchBubble per facility spot (ResearchBubble.populate). Tap a bubble / facility → SeasonHub.open_facility (FacilityView)."
